      <p class="oj-note">
         <a id="ntr2-L_202501775EN.000101-E0002" href="#ntc2-L_202501775EN.000101-E0002">(<span class="oj-super">2</span>)</a>  JOIN/2025/120 final, 19 March 2025.</p>
      <p class="oj-note">
         <a id="ntr3-L_202501775EN.000101-E0003" href="#ntc3-L_202501775EN.000101-E0003">(<span class="oj-super">3</span>)</a>  Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2020/1818 of 17 July 2020 supplementing Regulation (EU) 2016/1011 of the European Parliament and of the Council as regards minimum standards for EU Climate Transition Benchmarks and EU Paris-aligned Benchmarks (<a href="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/oj/JOL_2020_406_R_TOC">OJ L 406, 3.12.2020, p. 17</a>, ELI: <a href="http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_del/2020/1818/oj">http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_del/2020/1818/oj</a>).</p>
